id: pm-brief-decision-follow-through
title: Track declared outcomes after an adopted Decision
description: "Compose a read-only typed SDK and CLI follow-through brief for explicit Decision adoption, declared consequences, linked revision-bound observations and pending actions. Include strict bounded input, TOON/JSON budgets, isolated invalid records, native status roles, no-git and packed acceptance, seeded model-based validation and public tracker measurements."
type: Feature
status: closed
priority: 2
